ERROR [org.jboss.jca.core.connectionmanager.listener.TxConnectionListener]
IJ031070: Transaction cannot proceed: STATUS_MARKED_ROLLBACK

Caused by: javax.transaction.RollbackException: Transaction is marked for rollback only.

Possible causes:
- Previous exception in the same transaction.
- Non-XA datasource used with multiple transactional resources.
- Database timeout.
- EJB invocation failed before datasource enlistment.